 "notes": "Seated variant of perch_sit (take v4_a): from the ledge pose she clasps her hands between her knees (hands stay off her chest) and leans in so her upper arms squeeze her chest in a pin-up press, does a slow subtle shoulder shimmy with a weighty bounce, then settles back to the ledge pose; whole 7 s video (first = last = base_clean still), keyframes chest_press_squeeze / chest_press_shimmy. Built at scale 0.559 like cleavage_beckon so the body matches perch_sit size, then shifted up 15 px so the hands-on-edge seat line matches perch_sit (seat_y 240). deshadow.py rows 150-272 (little to remove), QA --fix (281 fringe px). Seat values measured like perch_sit on the built frames (alpha > 128): seat_y = lowest row in y 180-300 whose opaque span is >= 80% of the widest span, on the hands-on-ledge frames 0-5 and 78-83 (240 on all 12); seat_x_range = opaque run containing x=200 on rows 232/236/240 over all frames, p5 left / p95 right = [157, 234]; feet_lowest_y = max lowest opaque row = 375. Known minor flaw: fingers slightly soft while clasped at ~2-4 s.",
